  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Diyito Di Malaguene Fruit and Cereal Processing Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project funds will be used to improve and increase the group&apos;s production and marketing capacity and generate new employment opportunities in food processing. The funds will improve the production facility and fund the purchase of raw materials. Along with financial management and capacity building in marketing; this will increase the group&apos;s income; sustainable growth and development.</narrative>
  </description>
